prompt_block: An East Asian man in his mid-30s to early 40s, with a rounded face shape
  and smooth fair skin. He has short, neatly styled black hair parted to one side
  with soft sweeping bangs across his forehead. He maintains a calm, neutral facial
  expression, with his lips closed in a relaxed, straight line and his dark brown
  eyes looking forward without expression lines or crinkles. He wears classic thin-rimmed
  metal glasses with clear, transparent lenses and a simple frame. He has neatly defined
  dark eyebrows, a soft nose with a rounded bridge, and a gentle jawline. Average
  build, average height. He wears a crisp white long-sleeved shirt with the sleeves
  rolled to the forearm and the top button undone, navy trousers, a black belt and
  black leather shoes.
